	(text "Notes:\nPins:\n- IN2M, IN2P, IN1M, and IN1P - Connected to GND to power down \nanalog blocks of ADC channels since we're using PDM mics with \nGPIO pins. See section 7.3.7 bottom of page 45 of tac5212 data \nsheet for design suggestion.\n- MICBIAS: Pin left floating as per suggestion in TI forums. \nLink: https://e2e.ti.com/support/audio-group/audio/f/audio-forum/741882/pcm2912a-unused-pin-connection-for-unused-microphone"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
